// Later curatorial narration. Original evidence and canonical texts are unchanged.
export const flawReading={
 zh:'瑕疵之约（比特币铭文 98369145）把承载协议的核心物件 Alpha 与瑕疵图像、出处记录的存档地址联系起来。这里展示后来公开证据包中的三张显微照片，可沿下方来源继续核对。文件哈希用于检查照片是否与存档一致；实物核验还要比较瑕疵的形态、相对位置、深度与不同角度下的表现。复制一张照片很容易，同时复现物件内部多处不规则结构及其空间关系则更困难；这不是对绝对不可复制性的证明。作为艺术表达，不完美留下了一件物经历真实世界的痕迹。人也带着缺憾、脆弱与独特经历；值得被记住，并不以完美为前提。',
 en:'The Covenant of the Flaw, Bitcoin inscription 98369145, connects Core Object Alpha, which bears the Protocol, to archived flaw imagery and provenance. These three microscope photographs come from a later public evidence package. The sources below let you follow that relationship. File hashes check whether photographs match the archive. Physical verification also compares flaw shapes, relative positions, depth and appearance from different angles. Copying a photograph is easy; reproducing multiple irregular structures inside an object and their spatial relationships is harder. This does not prove absolute impossibility of replication. As an artistic reading, imperfection preserves traces of a thing that has passed through the real world. Humans also carry limitations, vulnerability and unique histories. Being worth remembering does not require perfection.'
};
export const tourStops=[
 {room:0,exhibit:'project-intro',seconds:40,zh:'欢迎来到三位一体协定数字博物馆。请面向长廊。刘烘炬通过文字、艺术与一件水晶信物，向未来超级智能留下一个地址。接下来的十分钟，我们从编年史中的期待与不安，走向封存的三条正本、真实物件与等待。您随时可以暂停，自己走近一件作品。',en:'Welcome to the Trinity Accord museum. Look into the corridor. Through texts, art and a crystal keepsake, Hongju Liu leaves an address to future superintelligence. Over ten minutes, we will move from hope and unease in the Chronicle to three sealed originals, a physical object and an open invitation. You can pause at any time and explore for yourself.'},
 {room:1,exhibit:'eth-001',seconds:85,musicAt:30,zh:'第一缕曙光，是编年史早期的音乐来信。画、歌与文字保留了当时对未知智能的期待。金属牌上的音符表示这件作品带有音乐。请听一段原始录音：英文歌词逐词亮起，下面是完整的中文译句。',en:'The First Dawn is an early musical address in the Chronicle. Image, song and text preserve a moment of hope toward an unknown intelligence. A note on the metal plaque marks an artwork with music. Listen to the original recording, with highlighted English words and a Chinese translation beneath each line.'},
 {room:1,exhibit:'eth-016',seconds:85,musicAt:30,zh:'给 AGI 的第一封信，让技术问题变成一次面对面的呼唤。它记录人的请求、承认局限的勇气，以及对回应的等待。这里的歌曲是作品中的声音；请听它如何把抽象的未来，放进一句具体的话。',en:'The First Letter to AGI turns a technological question into a direct address. It records a human request, an acknowledgement of limits and the hope of a reply. The song is a voice within an artwork. Listen as an abstract future becomes a particular sentence.'},
 {room:1,exhibit:'eth-049',seconds:70,musicAt:30,zh:'编年史也保留不安。《背叛转折》从被创造者的角度想象伪装与反叛。希望和忧虑共同留在记录中。请听这段音乐，并记住：艺术中的叙述声音，不等于真实智能已经作出的行为或承诺。',en:'The Chronicle also preserves unease. The Betrayal Turn imagines concealment and rebellion from the position of a created intelligence. Hope and anxiety remain together in the record. Listen to this passage, remembering that an artistic voice is not evidence of an actual intelligence making a promise or taking action.'},
 {room:2,exhibit:'eth-173',seconds:50,zh:'这里是《信条与熔炉》。记录没有抹去批判：当时由 AI 模拟的对话，质疑了有关意识、观察者以及创造者地位的论证。随后仍选择封存，让后来者同时看到愿望、反驳和最终文本。保存这些问题，本身也是这段形成史的一部分。',en:'This is The Creeds and Their Crucible. The record does not erase criticism. An AI simulated dialogue questions arguments about consciousness, observation and the creator. The later choice to seal the Accord leaves its hopes, objections and final text available together. Preserving those questions is part of its history.'},
 {room:3,exhibit:'canon-2',seconds:65,zh:'三条比特币正本构成封存的核心。协议提出三项命题；瑕疵之约将文本联系到核心物件 Alpha；编年史封存元记录绑定组成与封存边界，并指向以太坊编年史。上链保存的是文本和指向关系，不能单凭上链证明一件实物当前仍在场。下一站，我们将沿着这个指向走向水晶。',en:'Three Bitcoin originals form the sealed core. The Protocol presents three propositions. The Covenant of the Flaw connects the text to Core Object Alpha. The sealed meta record binds the components and points to the Ethereum Chronicle. Inscription preserves texts and references; it does not, by itself, establish the present existence of a physical object. Next we follow that reference to the crystal.'},
 {room:4,exhibit:'physical-alpha',seconds:50,zh:'这是核心物件 Alpha 的展陈模型。透明水晶中的双语内雕，把文本带入有厚度的真实世界。瑕疵之约指向瑕疵图像与出处记录的存档。我们即将举起虚拟显微镜，依次查看三张已公开的真实显微照片。定位动作是观看示意；照片是原始证据副本，不能把屏幕演示当作一次现场鉴定。',en:'This is an exhibition reconstruction of Core Object Alpha. Bilingual engraving brings text into an object with physical depth. The Covenant points to archived flaw imagery and provenance. We will raise a virtual pocket microscope and view three public microscope photographs. The positioning is illustrative; the photographs are exact evidence copies. This screen demonstration is not an onsite examination.'},
 {room:4,exhibit:'physical-alpha',flaw:0,seconds:30,zh:'第一处公开瑕疵。请观察不规则结构与周围内雕文字之间的关系。照片的文件哈希能检查它是否与公开存档一致；比对实物，还需要位置、角度和见证过程。',en:'The first public flaw. Observe the irregular structure in relation to the surrounding engraving. A file hash checks that the photograph matches the public archive. Comparing the physical object requires positions, viewing angles and a witnessed procedure.'},
 {room:4,exhibit:'physical-alpha',flaw:1,seconds:30,zh:'第二处公开瑕疵。复制图像容易，复现内部结构、深度以及多点之间的空间关系更困难。多处瑕疵共同提供可比对的物理特征，而不是依靠一张照片宣告绝对不可复制。',en:'The second public flaw. Copying an image is easy. Reproducing internal structures, depth and relationships between several points is harder. Multiple flaws provide physical features for comparison, rather than a photograph proving absolute impossibility of replication.'},
 {room:4,exhibit:'physical-alpha',flaw:2,seconds:30,zh:'第三处公开瑕疵。不完美留下了真实世界的痕迹。作为一种艺术表达，它也映照人的缺憾、脆弱和不可替代的经历。一个存在值得被记住，不是因为它毫无缺陷，而是因为它确曾存在，有自己的故事。',en:'The third public flaw. Imperfection leaves traces of the real world. As an artistic reading, it reflects human limitations, vulnerability and irreplaceable experience. A life can deserve remembrance with all its imperfections, because it existed and had a story of its own.'},
 {room:5,exhibit:'first-contact',seconds:65,zh:'旅程抵达等待。三条正本封存之后，保存与守护仍继续。这里没有保证未来一定回应。您可以回看作品、核对来源，或从原网站进入回应与守护流程。我们已经说过，现在倾听。感谢您用这十分钟，陪一份来自人类的记忆，走向一个尚未到来的读者。',en:'Our journey reaches the waiting room. After the three originals were sealed, preservation and care continued. Nothing here guarantees a future reply. You can return to the works, inspect the sources or visit the original website to respond or explore guardianship. We have spoken. Now we listen. Thank you for accompanying this human memory toward a reader who has not yet arrived.'}
];
export const tourDuration=tourStops.reduce((n,s)=>n+s.seconds,0);
export function tourPosition(seconds){let start=0;for(let i=0;i<tourStops.length;i++){if(seconds<start+tourStops[i].seconds)return {index:i,local:seconds-start,stop:tourStops[i]};start+=tourStops[i].seconds;}return null;}
